            "notes": [
                "U4 has the logo of IC Plus and no readable number; the schematic has none. Its id over MDIO is 0243 0c54: IC Plus, model 5, the id the IP101 driver of ESP-IDF checks. It does not say the letters after IP101. 25 MHz crystal; its 50 MHz output feeds RMII_CLK. The LAN transformer is a JXD B1603S.",
